      },
      {
        heading: 'Content',
        body: 'The text, design, and logo on this site belong to Nadeem Dev Apps. You may link to any page and quote it fairly, with credit. Please do not present our work as your own or copy the site wholesale.',
      },
      {
        heading: 'No warranties',
        body: 'This site is provided \u201cas is\u201d and \u201cas available\u201d, without warranties of any kind. We try to keep the information accurate and up to date, but we do not guarantee it.',
